title: HUD & callouts
description: The things a video draws on a picture to say “look here” and “this is what that is” — a point, an arrow, a box, a ring, a caption, a key, a cursor, a counter, a stepper, a readout, a sticker, a bracket.
eyebrow: Content creation · Elements
source: src/studio/hud.css
